1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,491
50,000 people are watching the highest-rated

2
00:00:03,511 --> 00:00:05,400
guy in the city fall apart.

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:07,627
And for the first time in his life, they

4
00:00:07,647 --> 00:00:09,800
can see the one number he's been paying

5
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:10,405
to hide.

6
00:00:10,555 --> 00:00:11,575
Let me back up.

7
00:00:14,325 --> 00:00:16,836
In this world, everyone has ratings floating

8
00:00:16,856 --> 00:00:17,876
above their heads.

9
00:00:18,026 --> 00:00:18,393
Strength.

10
00:00:18,503 --> 00:00:19,523
Athleticism.

11
00:00:19,633 --> 00:00:20,000
Health.

12
00:00:20,110 --> 00:00:20,695
IQ.

13
00:00:20,805 --> 00:00:21,390
EQ.

14
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,302
Mental health.

15
00:00:22,452 --> 00:00:23,471
They update live.

16
00:00:23,581 --> 00:00:26,263
Go for a run, your athleticism goes up.

17
00:00:26,373 --> 00:00:28,232
Skip a night of sleep, your health goes

18
00:00:28,252 --> 00:00:28,619
down.

19
00:00:28,769 --> 00:00:31,280
Say something cruel, and everyone watches

20
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,320
your EQ drop.

21
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:34,359
And everything runs on them.

22
00:00:34,469 --> 00:00:37,488
The café is hiring: EQ 70 and up.

23
00:00:37,638 --> 00:00:40,439
The gym is members only: strength 80 plus.

24
00:00:40,549 --> 00:00:43,308
The bank only lends to an 80 overall.

25
00:00:43,458 --> 00:00:46,651
And there's one rule everybody follows:

26
00:00:46,761 --> 00:00:48,915
you never date anyone more than ten points

27
00:00:48,935 --> 00:00:50,607
away from your own number.

28
00:00:53,357 --> 00:00:54,159
This is Theo.

29
00:00:54,269 --> 00:00:55,723
Overall 52.

30
00:00:55,833 --> 00:00:56,853
Strength 41.

31
00:00:56,963 --> 00:00:58,852
Athleticism 47.

32
00:00:58,962 --> 00:01:00,417
IQ 104.

33
00:01:00,527 --> 00:01:01,763
EQ 93.

34
00:01:01,913 --> 00:01:04,595
In this city, that's painfully average.

35
00:01:04,745 --> 00:01:07,333
At the very bottom of his card there's a

36
00:01:07,353 --> 00:01:08,373
small grey number.

37
00:01:08,483 --> 00:01:10,415
Potential: 99.

38
00:01:10,565 --> 00:01:12,671
Nobody reads the small grey number.

39
00:01:12,781 --> 00:01:13,801
Not even Theo.

40
00:01:13,951 --> 00:01:15,405
Theo is in love with Mia.

41
00:01:15,515 --> 00:01:16,970
Overall 88.

42
00:01:17,080 --> 00:01:18,969
IQ 131.

43
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:20,316
EQ 96.

44
00:01:20,466 --> 00:01:22,137
That's a 36-point gap.

45
00:01:22,247 --> 00:01:24,277
In this city, that's not a crush.

46
00:01:24,387 --> 00:01:25,189
That's a joke.

47
00:01:25,339 --> 00:01:27,555
The thing is, the day they met, Theo wasn't

48
00:01:27,575 --> 00:01:28,160
okay.

49
00:01:28,270 --> 00:01:30,594
His mental health had been sinking for weeks.

50
00:01:30,704 --> 00:01:31,506
61.

51
00:01:31,616 --> 00:01:32,418
52.

52
00:01:32,528 --> 00:01:33,330
44.

53
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:36,022
Thousands of people walked past that number.

54
00:01:36,132 --> 00:01:37,369
They could all see it.

55
00:01:37,479 --> 00:01:38,933
Nobody said a word.

56
00:01:39,083 --> 00:01:41,190
Mia was the first one who stopped.

57
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:43,811
She sat down next to him and asked, "Are

58
00:01:43,831 --> 00:01:44,633
you okay?"

59
00:01:44,743 --> 00:01:45,763
And then she stayed.

60
00:01:45,913 --> 00:01:49,153
Every time she laughed at one of his terrible

61
00:01:49,173 --> 00:01:51,855
jokes, his mental health went up by one.

62
00:01:52,005 --> 00:01:54,299
But when two people look at each other,

63
00:01:54,319 --> 00:01:55,990
one more number appears.

64
00:01:56,100 --> 00:01:57,555
Compatibility.

65
00:01:57,705 --> 00:01:59,637
Theo and Mia: zero percent.

66
00:01:59,747 --> 00:02:01,900
And standing right behind her is the guy

67
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:04,679
she's 97% compatible with.

68
00:02:04,829 --> 00:02:05,197
Kai.

69
00:02:05,307 --> 00:02:06,761
Overall 94.

70
00:02:06,871 --> 00:02:08,108
Strength 97.

71
00:02:08,218 --> 00:02:09,890
Athleticism 98.

72
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,019
Two-time champion.

73
00:02:11,169 --> 00:02:13,710
He won't shake hands with anyone under 80.

74
00:02:13,820 --> 00:02:15,275
His EQ is 19.

75
00:02:15,385 --> 00:02:18,361
And one line on his card is completely blank.

76
00:02:18,511 --> 00:02:20,805
Because if you're rich enough, you can pay

77
00:02:20,825 --> 00:02:22,279
to hide one number.

78
00:02:22,389 --> 00:02:25,365
Kai pays 9,999 a month.

79
00:02:28,115 --> 00:02:30,657
Every year the city holds The Ranking.

80
00:02:30,767 --> 00:02:32,361
Three rounds, live on TV.

81
00:02:32,511 --> 00:02:34,805
The winner's card turns gold, and gold outranks

82
00:02:34,825 --> 00:02:36,062
every number.

83
00:02:36,212 --> 00:02:37,231
So Theo signs up.

84
00:02:37,341 --> 00:02:39,853
The clerk reads his 52 out loud, and the

85
00:02:39,873 --> 00:02:41,110
whole stadium laughs.

86
00:02:41,260 --> 00:02:42,637
Round one, the race.

87
00:02:42,747 --> 00:02:44,636
Kai wins without breaking a sweat.

88
00:02:44,746 --> 00:02:46,200
Theo comes in dead last.

89
00:02:46,310 --> 00:02:47,112
By a lot.

90
00:02:47,262 --> 00:02:48,639
Round two, the puzzle.

91
00:02:48,749 --> 00:02:50,421
And something strange happens.

92
00:02:50,531 --> 00:02:52,825
Theo's IQ starts climbing, live on the giant

93
00:02:52,845 --> 00:02:53,212
screen.

94
00:02:53,322 --> 00:02:54,342
104.

95
00:02:54,452 --> 00:02:55,471
105.

96
00:02:55,581 --> 00:02:56,601
106.

97
00:02:56,751 --> 00:02:57,553
Second place.

98
00:02:57,663 --> 00:03:00,344
For the first time all day, nobody's laughing.

99
00:03:00,494 --> 00:03:02,383
Then the final is announced.

100
00:03:02,493 --> 00:03:05,657
Partners are random, and every hidden number

101
00:03:05,677 --> 00:03:06,697
gets switched off.

102
00:03:06,847 --> 00:03:07,649
The screen spins.

103
00:03:07,759 --> 00:03:08,561
Theo's partner?

104
00:03:08,671 --> 00:03:09,038
Kai.

105
00:03:09,188 --> 00:03:10,208
The filters drop.

106
00:03:10,318 --> 00:03:12,642
Every card in the stadium flickers.

107
00:03:12,752 --> 00:03:14,206
And Kai's blank line lights up.

108
00:03:14,356 --> 00:03:15,636
Mental health: 12.

109
00:03:15,746 --> 00:03:16,983
It's been 12 for years.

110
00:03:17,093 --> 00:03:18,764
That's what he was paying to hide.

111
00:03:21,514 --> 00:03:22,969
The final is a wall.

112
00:03:23,079 --> 00:03:26,025
Halfway up, Kai looks down at 50,000 people

113
00:03:26,045 --> 00:03:27,282
reading his number.

114
00:03:27,432 --> 00:03:27,799
9.

115
00:03:27,909 --> 00:03:28,277
6.

116
00:03:28,387 --> 00:03:28,754
4.

117
00:03:28,864 --> 00:03:29,666
He freezes.

118
00:03:29,776 --> 00:03:30,796
He can't go up.

119
00:03:30,906 --> 00:03:31,925
He can't go down.

120
00:03:32,075 --> 00:03:33,964
Theo could climb right past him and win.

121
00:03:34,074 --> 00:03:35,669
Instead, he climbs back down.

122
00:03:35,819 --> 00:03:36,838
He doesn't pull him.

123
00:03:36,948 --> 00:03:37,968
He doesn't push him.

124
00:03:38,078 --> 00:03:39,315
He just talks to him.

125
00:03:39,465 --> 00:03:40,484
"Don't look at them.

126
00:03:40,594 --> 00:03:41,831
Look at the next hold.

127
00:03:41,941 --> 00:03:43,396
I'm not going anywhere."

128
00:03:43,546 --> 00:03:45,917
And the whole stadium watches the number

129
00:03:45,937 --> 00:03:46,522
come back.

130
00:03:46,632 --> 00:03:46,999
10.

131
00:03:47,109 --> 00:03:47,911
25.

132
00:03:48,021 --> 00:03:48,606
40.

133
00:03:48,756 --> 00:03:50,785
Hold by hold, they climb together.

134
00:03:50,895 --> 00:03:52,350
They cross the line dead last.

135
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:54,871
Then the judges reveal how the final was

136
00:03:54,891 --> 00:03:55,476
scored.

137
00:03:55,586 --> 00:03:56,388
Not by time.

138
00:03:56,498 --> 00:03:58,387
By how much your ratings changed.

139
00:03:58,537 --> 00:04:01,730
Kai's EQ jumped 40 points in one afternoon.

140
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,208
Theo's?

141
00:04:02,318 --> 00:04:04,207
Every single stat went up.

142
00:04:04,357 --> 00:04:05,377
His card turns gold.

143
00:04:05,487 --> 00:04:08,215
And for the first time, 50,000 people read

144
00:04:08,235 --> 00:04:09,472
the small grey number.

145
00:04:09,582 --> 00:04:11,514
Potential: 99.

146
00:04:14,264 --> 00:04:16,558
That night, Mia walks right past the 97

147
00:04:16,578 --> 00:04:18,250
and stands next to the zero.

148
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:21,423
Because compatibility only measures how

149
00:04:21,443 --> 00:04:23,115
alike two people are.

150
00:04:23,225 --> 00:04:24,679
They were nothing alike.

151
00:04:24,789 --> 00:04:25,809
That was the point.

152
00:04:25,959 --> 00:04:26,901
Oh, and Kai?

153
00:04:27,011 --> 00:04:29,117
He cancelled his privacy plan.

154
00:04:29,227 --> 00:04:31,164
His mental health is right there on his

155
00:04:31,184 --> 00:04:32,856
card for everyone to see.

156
00:04:32,966 --> 00:04:34,420
It's 71 now.

157
00:04:34,570 --> 00:04:37,299
50 years later, Theo and Mia are still on

158
00:04:37,319 --> 00:04:39,130
the same bench, still holding hands.

159
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:42,082
Compatibility: still zero percent.

160
00:04:42,192 --> 00:04:44,123
Mental health: both 100.

161
00:04:44,273 --> 00:04:46,567
And every time she laughs, it still tries

162
00:04:46,587 --> 00:04:48,042
to go up by one.

163
00:04:48,192 --> 00:04:50,626
So, if you could hide one rating, which

164
00:04:50,646 --> 00:04:51,883
one would it be?

165
00:04:51,993 --> 00:04:53,447
Tell me in the comments.
